From d9f5c6b28ef6e25b474820b75ca4cc6dd6382fa2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xonel <xonel@github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:57:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] cameras: add experimental Jooan W3-U dual-sensor profiles

Dual SC2336P and dual CV2003 variants, pinned to U-Boot 2013.07.
Sensor reset GPIOs (18/16) and MIPI switch GPIO (7) are taken from the
W8-U profile and are not yet confirmed on W3-U hardware.
